    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      572.95,
      549.66,
      598.29
    ],
    "text": "(a) declare that the area of land called \u201cVeediyagoda Raja Maha Vihara Secred Area\u201d speci\ufb01ed in the Schedule hereto shall be an Urban development area for the purpose of the aforesaid Ordinance; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
